       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. L06.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PRICE PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 12.50.
       01 WS-QUANTITY PIC 9(3) VALUE 4.
       01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           MULTIPLY WS-PRICE BY WS-QUANTITY GIVING WS-TOTAL
           DISPLAY "TOTAL=" WS-TOTAL
           ADD 1 TO WS-QUANTITY
           DISPLAY "NEXT QUANTITY=" WS-QUANTITY
           STOP RUN.
